    "breadcrumb": "Suporte Swing Catalyst \u003e Câmeras e Vídeo",
    "content": "Desejo usar Halcon, mas não tenho certeza quais padrões minha(s) câmera(s) suporta(m) Normalmente o fabricante mencionará quais padrões suportam explicitamente na documentação ou se a documentação ou material de marketing contiverem os logos USB3 Vision, GigE Vision ou GenICam.\nHere’s an example from Basler: https://www.baslerweb.com/en/products/cameras/area-scan-cameras/scout/sca640-120gc/\nUsually camera manufactures will mention what standards their products conform to, in the below example you can see it supports GenICam and GigE Vision, which is what we want.\nYou can also find more information here:\nDoes your camera support USB3 Vision?\nDoes your camera support GigE Vision?\nLast updated: 2024-06-03 | View on official support site",
